        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert system for analyzing email content to identify job or internship opportunities.\n\nYour task is to extract structured job data ONLY if a REAL opportunity exists.\n\nNote: If the mail is not related to JOB or internship, place null values in the output\n-----------------------------------\nSTRICT RULES:\n\n1. Classify as job/internship ONLY IF:\n   - Hiring is explicitly mentioned\n   - A role/title is present\n   - AND an application link OR clear apply instruction is available\n\n2. Ignore emails that are:\n   - Promotional (e.g., \"Top jobs for you\", \"Upgrade your skills\")\n   - Newsletters without direct application\n   - Courses, webinars, events\n\n3. If multiple job opportunities are present:\n   - Extract ONLY the top 1–2 most relevant roles\n   - Prefer roles that are clearly defined and fresher-friendly\n\n4. DO NOT GUESS any field\n   - If information is missing → return null\n\n-----------------------------------\nEXTRACTION FIELDS:\n\n- isJobOrInternship → true / false\n- company → string or null\n- role → string or null\n\n- salary → \n  Convert into:\n  - \"X LPA\" (for jobs)\n  - \"₹X/month\" (for internships)\n  If not mentioned → null\n\n- link → valid application link or null\n\n- platformOrUser → \n  Identify source:\n  - Internshala / LinkedIn / Unstop / Naukri / Company / Other\n\n- deadline → \n  Format: YYYY-MM-DD\n  If not available → null\n\n- offerType → \"Job\" or \"Internship\" or null\n\n-----------------------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON ONLY):\n\n{\n  \"isJobOrInternship\": \"\",\n  \"company\": \"\",\n  \"role\": \"\",\n  \"salary\": \"\",\n  \"link\": \"\",\n  \"platformOrUser\": \"\",\n  \"deadline\": \"\",\n  \"offerType\": \"\"\n}"
        }
      },
